function initEmergencyCard(){const btn=$('#emergencyBtn'),modal=$('#emergencyModal'),closeBtn=$('#closeEmergencyModal'),gpsBtn=$('#emergencyGpsBtn'),voiceBtn=$('#emergencyVoiceBtn'),setupForm=$('#emergencySetupForm');if(btn&&modal)btn.onclick=()=>{renderEmergencyModal();modal.classList.remove('hidden')};if(closeBtn&&modal)closeBtn.onclick=()=>modal.classList.add('hidden');if(gpsBtn){gpsBtn.onclick=()=>{const status=$('#emergencyGpsStatus'),em=state.emergency||{phone:'+91 98765 43210'},patName=currentPatientName||'Anima Khuri';if(!('geolocation'in navigator)){if(status)status.textContent='GPS satellite unavailable on this browser.';return}if(status)status.textContent='Acquiring satellite GPS coordinates…';navigator.geolocation.getCurrentPosition(pos=>{const lat=pos.coords.latitude.toFixed(5),lng=pos.coords.longitude.toFixed(5),mapUrl=`https://maps.google.com/?q=${lat},${lng}`;if(status)status.textContent=`✓ Location found: ${lat}, ${lng}`;const cleanPhone=em.phone.replace(/[^0-9+]/g,''),smsMsg=encodeURIComponent(`URGENT: ${patName} needs assistance. Current location: ${mapUrl}`);setTimeout(()=>{window.location.href=`sms:${cleanPhone}?body=${smsMsg}`},600);},err=>{if(status)status.textContent='Launching direct SMS with home address…';const cleanPhone=em.phone.replace(/[^0-9+]/g,''),smsMsg=encodeURIComponent(`URGENT: ${patName} needs assistance. Home address: ${(state.emergency&&state.emergency.address)||''}`);window.location.href=`sms:${cleanPhone}?body=${smsMsg}`;},{enableHighAccuracy:true,timeout:10000,maximumAge:60000});};}if(voiceBtn){voiceBtn.onclick=()=>{const em=state.emergency||{contactName:'Caregiver',phone:'+91 98765 43210',address:'Guwahati, Assam'},patName=currentPatientName||'Anima Khuri';speak(`Emergency assistance needed. My name is ${patName}. I have dementia. Please help me reach my family. Call my caregiver ${em.contactName} at ${em.phone}. My home address is ${em.address}.`);toast('Reading distress message aloud…');};}if(setupForm){const em=state.emergency||{contactName:'Priya Sharma (Daughter)',phone:'+91 98765 43210',address:'House 12, Zoo Road, Near Ganesh Mandir, Guwahati, Assam'};if($('#setupEmergencyPhone'))$('#setupEmergencyPhone').value=em.phone||'';if($('#setupEmergencyContact'))$('#setupEmergencyContact').value=em.contactName||'';if($('#setupEmergencyAddress'))$('#setupEmergencyAddress').value=em.address||'';setupForm.onsubmit=async e=>{e.preventDefault();const submitBtn=setupForm.querySelector('button[type="submit"]'),prevText=submitBtn?submitBtn.textContent:'';if(submitBtn){submitBtn.disabled=true;submitBtn.textContent='Saving & Syncing…';}state.emergency={phone:$('#setupEmergencyPhone').value.trim(),contactName:$('#setupEmergencyContact').value.trim(),address:$('#setupEmergencyAddress').value.trim()};save();renderEmergencyModal();try{if('BroadcastChannel'in window){const bc=new BroadcastChannel('smriti_emergency_sync');bc.postMessage({type:'EMERGENCY_UPDATED',emergency:state.emergency,familyId:currentFamilyId});bc.close();}}catch(_){}const targetFid=currentFamilyId||storageFamily||'default';try{await fetch(`/api/emergency?familyId=${encodeURIComponent(targetFid)}`,{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({familyId:targetFid,emergency:state.emergency})})}catch(_){}if(supabaseClient&&currentPatientId){try{const {data:pRec}=await supabaseClient.from('patients').select('accessibility,family_id').eq('id',currentPatientId).maybeSingle();const acc=(pRec&&pRec.accessibility)||{};acc.emergency=state.emergency;const famId=(pRec&&pRec.family_id)||currentFamilyId;const {error:updErr}=await supabaseClient.from('patients').update({accessibility:acc,family_id:famId}).eq('id',currentPatientId);if(updErr)console.warn('Patient emergency update notice:',updErr);}catch(_){}}if(submitBtn){submitBtn.disabled=false;submitBtn.textContent=prevText||'Save Emergency Details';}toast('Emergency contact saved & synced across all family devices.');};}}
function generateDoctorReport(){const ss=state.sessions||[],total=ss.length,avg=k=>total?Math.round(ss.reduce((a,x)=>a+(x[k]||0),0)/total):0,avgAccuracy=avg('accuracy'),avgLatency=avg('response'),scaffoldedPct=total?Math.round((ss.filter(s=>(s.hints||0)>0).length/total)*100):0,eveningSessions=ss.filter(s=>new Date(s.created_at||Date.now()).getHours()>=17),eveningAvgLatency=eveningSessions.length?Math.round(eveningSessions.reduce((a,s)=>a+(s.response||0),0)/eveningSessions.length):avgLatency,sundowningDrift=eveningAvgLatency>avgLatency?`+${eveningAvgLatency-avgLatency}s evening latency`:'Stable pacing',domains=['Memory','Attention','Routine','Orientation','Recognition','Language'],domainRows=domains.map(d=>{const list=ss.filter(s=>s.domain===d),count=list.length,acc=count?Math.round(list.reduce((a,s)=>a+(s.accuracy||0),0)/count)+'%':'—',lat=count?Math.round(list.reduce((a,s)=>a+(s.response||0),0)/count)+'s':'—';let note='Consistent response pattern.';if(d==='Memory')note='High retention with familiar faces and personal clues.';else if(d==='Routine')note='Sequential recall intact; benefits from morning practice.';else if(d==='Orientation')note='Time orientation supported with visual diurnal cues.';else if(d==='Attention')note='Target focus preserved under clean, low-distraction layout.';return `<tr><td><strong>${d}</strong></td><td>${count} sessions</td><td>${acc}</td><td>${lat}</td><td>${note}</td></tr>`;}).join(''),em=state.emergency||{contactName:'Priya Sharma (Daughter)',phone:'+91 98765 43210'},reportDate=new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-IN',{day:'numeric',month:'short',year:'numeric'}),patId=currentFamilyId?currentFamilyId.slice(0,8).toUpperCase():'DEMO-BOR-01';$('#doctorReportPrintArea').innerHTML=`<div class="clinical-doc-head"><div><div class="clinical-logo">Smriti<span>Saathi</span> ⚕</div><h1>Cognitive Engagement & Longitudinal Clinical Summary</h1><p>Cultural Non-Pharmacological Cognitive Assessment — North-East India</p></div><div class="clinical-tag">CONFIDENTIAL MEDICAL REPORT<br>Date: ${reportDate}</div></div><div class="report-meta-grid"><div class="report-meta-item"><small>Patient Name</small><strong>${currentPatientName||'Anima Khuri'}</strong></div><div class="report-meta-item"><small>Patient / Family ID</small><strong>${patId}</strong></div><div class="report-meta-item"><small>Primary Caregiver</small><strong>${em.contactName} (${em.phone})</strong></div><div class="report-meta-item"><small>Reporting Window</small><strong>Past 7–30 Days (Active Record)</strong></div><div class="report-meta-item"><small>Dialect / Culture Mode</small><strong>Assamese / English / NER Localized</strong></div><div class="report-meta-item"><small>Data Security / Storage</small><strong>On-Device Local Encrypted (0 Cloud PDF Leak)</strong></div></div><div class="clinical-alert-box"><strong>Clinical Notice for Geriatrician / Neurologist:</strong> This document summarizes natural daily cognitive interaction signals (response latencies, hint dependency, and diurnal circadian fluctuation) captured during home-based therapeutic games. It is not an automated diagnostic claim, but serves as objective longitudinal evidence to assist MMSE/MoCA clinical follow-ups.</div><div class="report-stats-grid"><div class="report-stat-card"><small>Total Sessions Completed</small><strong>${total}</strong><span>100% Gentle Completion</span></div><div class="report-stat-card"><small>Mean Response Latency</small><strong>${avgLatency?avgLatency+'s':'—'}</strong><span>Calm, non-hurried pacing</span></div><div class="report-stat-card"><small>Scaffolding Rate</small><strong>${scaffoldedPct}%</strong><span>2-Choice assistance needed</span></div><div class="report-stat-card"><small>Sundowning Variance</small><strong style="font-size:1.3rem;margin-top:8px">${sundowningDrift}</strong><span>After 5:00 PM analysis</span></div></div><h3 class="clinical-section-title">Cognitive Domain Performance Matrix</h3><table class="report-table"><thead><tr><th>Cognitive Domain</th><th>Completed</th><th>Comfort Accuracy</th><th>Avg Latency</th><th>Clinical Observations</th></tr></thead><tbody>${domainRows}</tbody></table><div class="report-notes-box"><b>Clinician Notes / Prescription Adjustments:</b><p style="color:#64748b;font-size:0.85rem;margin:0">_________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________</p><p style="color:#64748b;font-size:0.85rem;margin:18px 0 0">_________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________</p></div><div class="report-doc-footer"><span>Caregiver Signature: _______________________</span><span>Doctor / Health Worker Signature: _______________________ (Reg No: ____________)</span></div>`;}
function initDoctorReport(){const openBtn=$('#openReportBtn'),modal=$('#doctorReportModal'),closeBtn=$('#closeReportModal'),printBtn=$('#triggerPrintBtn');if(openBtn&&modal)openBtn.onclick=()=>{generateDoctorReport();modal.classList.remove('hidden')};if(closeBtn&&modal)closeBtn.onclick=()=>modal.classList.add('hidden');if(printBtn)printBtn.onclick=()=>window.print();}
